Lumen's onboarding at `/`: a four-step wizard (1 Account: name and work email; 2 Workspace: workspace name and team size; 3 Invite: up to three teammate emails, skippable; 4 Preferences: theme and weekly digest). A step indicator shows where the user is. Back and Next move between steps; Next validates the current step and shows inline errors instead of moving on. A summary card beside the form (below it on phones) shows what has been entered so far. Finishing goes to `/welcome`, a done screen with a short checklist of next steps.

